Object.assign(I18N["fil"].t, {"Passport": "Passport", "Entry permit": "Entry permit", "UAE residence visa": "UAE residence visa", "Emirates ID": "Emirates ID", "Health insurance": "Health insurance", "UK visa (eVisa end date)": "UK visa (end date ng eVisa)", "Share code": "Share code", "Tenancy contract": "Tenancy contract", "Renew it through your country’s embassy or consulate. Many visa steps need a passport with at least 6 months left, so start early.": "I-renew ito sa embassy o consulate ng bansa mo. Maraming hakbang sa visa ang nangangailangan ng passport na may natitira pang hindi bababa sa 6 na buwan, kaya magsimula nang maaga.", "You must arrive in the UAE before your entry permit runs out. If your travel is delayed, tell whoever applied for it straight away.": "Kailangan mong makarating sa UAE bago mag-expire ang entry permit mo. Kung maaantala ang biyahe mo, sabihan agad ang nag-apply nito.", "Your sponsor (university, employer or family member) renews it. Ask them about renewal well before it runs out.": "Ang sponsor mo (unibersidad, employer o kapamilya) ang nagre-renew nito. Tanungin sila tungkol sa renewal bago pa ito mag-expire.", "It’s renewed together with your residence visa. Ask your sponsor, and check the status on ICP.": "Nire-renew ito kasabay ng residence visa mo. Tanungin ang sponsor mo, at tingnan ang status sa ICP.", "Health insurance is required in Dubai. Ask whoever arranged it (university, employer or sponsor) how it renews.": "Kailangan ang health insurance sa Dubai. Tanungin ang nag-ayos nito (unibersidad, employer o sponsor) kung paano ito nire-renew.", "Check the end date in your UKVI account. Talk to your university’s immigration team well before it ends about what comes next.": "Tingnan ang end date sa UKVI account mo. Kausapin ang immigration team ng unibersidad mo bago pa ito matapos tungkol sa susunod na gagawin.", "Share codes last 90 days. Make a new one on GOV.UK whenever you need it: it’s free.": "90 araw ang bisa ng share code. Gumawa ng bago sa GOV.UK kapag kailangan mo: libre ito.", "Talk to your landlord about renewing before the contract ends, and renew your Ejari registration with it.": "Kausapin ang landlord mo tungkol sa pag-renew bago matapos ang kontrata, at i-renew din ang Ejari registration.", "Track document expiry dates": "Subaybayan ang expiry ng mga dokumento", "Get reminded before your passport or visa runs out": "Mapaalalahanan bago mag-expire ang passport o visa mo"});
