Object.assign(I18N["fil"].t, {"Have your passport and the form from your university ready.": "Ihanda ang passport mo at ang form mula sa university mo.", "The test is a blood sample and a chest X-ray.": "Ang test ay blood sample at chest X-ray.", "You don’t get a result on the spot: your university receives it, usually within a few working days.": "Hindi mo makukuha agad ang resulta: ang university mo ang tatanggap nito, kadalasan sa loob ng ilang working days.", "Afterwards: your university moves your application on to fingerprints.": "Pagkatapos: itutuloy ng university mo ang application mo sa fingerprints.", "Have your passport and the appointment email ready.": "Ihanda ang passport mo at ang appointment email.", "You don’t get your Emirates ID that day. The card is made later, and you’re told when it’s ready.": "Hindi mo makukuha ang Emirates ID mo sa araw na iyon. Gagawin ang card mamaya, at sasabihan ka kapag handa na ito.", "Your university usually tells you where to collect the card. Often it’s at the university.": "Kadalasan sasabihin ng university mo kung saan kukunin ang card. Madalas, sa university mismo.", "Keep your passport with you when you collect it.": "Dalhin ang passport mo kapag kukunin mo ito.", "A UAE residence visa": "UAE residence visa", "An Emirates ID card": "Emirates ID card", "Your Emirates ID card": "Ang Emirates ID card mo", "Get around by Metro and bus": "Bumiyahe gamit ang Metro at bus", "A bank account": "Bank account", "A debit card": "Debit card", "Your card and PIN (never share the PIN)": "Ang card at PIN mo (huwag kailanman ibigay ang PIN)", "A tenancy contract": "Tenancy contract", "Your contract and Ejari certificate": "Ang contract mo at Ejari certificate", "A UKVI account with your eVisa": "UKVI account na may eVisa mo", "A way to make share codes": "Paraan para gumawa ng share codes", "Your UKVI login details": "Ang UKVI login details mo", "The practice may ask for proof of identity and proof of your address. Students may be asked for proof they’re studying.": "Maaaring humingi ang practice ng proof of identity at proof ng address mo. Maaaring hingan ang mga student ng patunay na nag-aaral sila.", "They register you if you live in their area and they’re taking new patients. If not, try the next practice.": "Irerehistro ka nila kung nakatira ka sa area nila at tumatanggap sila ng bagong pasyente. Kung hindi, subukan ang susunod na practice.", "A GP practice you’re registered with": "GP practice kung saan ka naka-register", "Your practice’s phone number": "Ang phone number ng practice mo", "The bank checks your documents, in the app or at the branch.": "Susuriin ng bank ang documents mo, sa app o sa branch.", "Your debit card comes by post afterwards. Set up the bank’s app while you wait.": "Darating ang debit card mo sa koreo pagkatapos. I-set up ang app ng bank habang naghihintay.", "Go to the Medical Fitness Centre at your appointment time with your registration form, passport or Emirates ID, a white-background photo and a copy of your e-visa.": "Pumunta sa Medical Fitness Centre sa oras ng appointment mo, dala ang registration form, passport o Emirates ID, litratong puti ang background at kopya ng e-visa mo.", "Your result comes later by text message or email.": "Darating ang resulta mo mamaya sa text message o email.", "At an ICP service centre, staff take your fingerprints and signature.": "Sa ICP service centre, kukunin ng staff ang fingerprints at pirma mo.", "You don’t get your Emirates ID that day. You can check its status in the UAEICP app.": "Hindi mo makukuha ang Emirates ID mo sa araw na iyon. Puwede mong i-check ang status nito sa UAEICP app.", "Did you come to the UAE to study at a university or college?": "Pumunta ka ba sa UAE para mag-aral sa university o college?", "Has your university sent you visa forms, or asked for your passport and a photo?": "Pinadalhan ka na ba ng university mo ng visa forms, o hiningan ng passport at litrato?", "Has a company in the UAE offered you a job?": "May kumpanya ba sa UAE na nag-alok sa iyo ng trabaho?", "Are you joining a husband, wife or parent who lives in the UAE?": "Sasama ka ba sa asawa o magulang na nakatira sa UAE?", "Are you applying on your own, for example as an investor, freelancer, remote worker or retiree?": "Mag-a-apply ka ba nang mag-isa, halimbawa bilang investor, freelancer, remote worker o retiree?", "Check with your university’s admissions or visa office first. Most universities sponsor their international students.": "Magtanong muna sa admissions o visa office ng university mo. Karamihan ng university ay nag-i-sponsor ng kanilang international students.", "Call GDRFA Dubai (Amer) on 800 5111 and tell them why you’re in the UAE. They can tell you who should apply for your residence.": "Tumawag sa GDRFA Dubai (Amer) sa 800 5111 at sabihin kung bakit ka nasa UAE. Masasabi nila kung sino ang dapat mag-apply para sa residence mo.", "The organisation or person responsible for your residence application: often your university, your employer or a family member.": "Ang organisasyon o tao na responsable sa residence application mo: madalas ang university mo, employer mo o kapamilya.", "Permission to enter the UAE to start your residence. It has an expiry date: you must arrive before it runs out.": "Pahintulot na pumasok sa UAE para simulan ang residence mo. May expiry date ito: kailangan mong dumating bago ito mag-expire.", "Biometrics (fingerprints)": "Biometrics (fingerprints)", "Your fingerprints and signature, taken for your Emirates ID. Everyone aged 15 and over gives them.": "Ang fingerprints at pirma mo, kinukuha para sa Emirates ID mo. Lahat ng edad 15 pataas ay nagbibigay nito.", "Medical fitness test": "Medical fitness test", "A routine health check for new UAE residents aged 18 and over: a blood test and a chest X-ray.": "Karaniwang health check para sa mga bagong residente ng UAE na edad 18 pataas: blood test at chest X-ray.", "Permission to live in the UAE. Your Emirates ID is valid for as long as your residence visa.": "Pahintulot na tumira sa UAE. Valid ang Emirates ID mo hangga't valid ang residence visa mo.", "The UAE’s ID card for residents. You need it for most services, like banks and UAE PASS.": "Ang ID card ng UAE para sa mga residente. Kailangan mo ito sa karamihan ng serbisyo, gaya ng bank at UAE PASS.", "PRAN": "PRAN", "Your Emirates ID application number. Your visa office has it, and you can use it to check your card’s status.": "Ang application number ng Emirates ID mo. Nasa visa office mo ito, at magagamit mo ito para i-check ang status ng card mo.", "ICP": "ICP", "The Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs and Port Security. It issues Emirates ID cards.": "Ang Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs and Port Security. Sila ang naglalabas ng Emirates ID cards.", "GDRFA": "GDRFA", "Dubai’s residency authority (General Directorate of Residency and Foreigners Affairs). It handles residence visas in Dubai.": "Ang residency authority ng Dubai (General Directorate of Residency and Foreigners Affairs). Sila ang humahawak ng residence visas sa Dubai.", "Amer": "Amer", "GDRFA Dubai’s service centres and helpline (800 5111) for visa questions.": "Ang mga service centre at helpline (800 5111) ng GDRFA Dubai para sa mga tanong tungkol sa visa.", "UAE PASS": "UAE PASS", "The UAE’s national digital ID. You set it up with your Emirates ID and use it to log in to government apps.": "Ang national digital ID ng UAE. I-set up mo ito gamit ang Emirates ID mo at gamitin para mag-log in sa government apps.", "PRO": "PRO", "Public Relations Officer: the person at a company or university who handles visa paperwork.": "Public Relations Officer: ang tao sa kumpanya o university na humahawak ng visa paperwork.", "The UAE Ministry of Human Resources and Emiratisation. It handles work permits and workers’ rights. Free advice line: 80084.": "Ang UAE Ministry of Human Resources and Emiratisation. Sila ang humahawak ng work permits at karapatan ng mga manggagawa. Libreng advice line: 80084.", "Dubai’s system for registering tenancy contracts.": "Ang sistema ng Dubai para sa pag-register ng tenancy contracts.", "eVisa": "eVisa", "Your UK immigration status as an online record, instead of a card. You see it in your UKVI account.": "Ang UK immigration status mo bilang online record, sa halip na card. Makikita mo ito sa UKVI account mo.", "UKVI": "UKVI", "UK Visas and Immigration: the part of the Home Office that runs visas.": "UK Visas and Immigration: ang bahagi ng Home Office na nagpapatakbo ng visas.", "A 9-character code that lets an employer or landlord check your status online. It lasts 90 days.": "9-character code na nagpapahintulot sa employer o landlord na i-check online ang status mo. Tumatagal ito ng 90 araw.", "BRP": "BRP", "Biometric residence permit: the old UK visa card that eVisas have replaced.": "Biometric residence permit: ang lumang UK visa card na pinalitan na ng eVisas.", "GWF number": "GWF number", "The reference number from your UK visa application. It’s in your application emails.": "Ang reference number mula sa UK visa application mo. Nasa application emails mo ito.", "GP": "GP", "General practitioner: your family doctor, and the first place to go for most health problems.": "General practitioner: ang family doctor mo, at ang unang pupuntahan para sa karamihan ng problema sa kalusugan.", "Scotland’s 111 service: urgent health advice when your GP is closed.": "Ang 111 service ng Scotland: urgent na health advice kapag sarado ang GP mo.", "National Insurance number": "National Insurance number", "Your personal number for tax and National Insurance in the UK. It stays the same for life.": "Ang personal number mo para sa tax at National Insurance sa UK. Pareho ito habambuhay.", "Council tax": "Council tax", "A yearly charge on each home for local services. Homes where everyone is a full-time student don’t pay it.": "Taunang bayad sa bawat bahay para sa local services. Hindi nagbabayad ang mga bahay kung saan full-time student ang lahat.", "HMO": "HMO", "A home shared by 3 or more people who aren’t related. It needs a licence.": "Bahay na pinagsasaluhan ng 3 o higit pang tao na hindi magkakamag-anak. Kailangan nito ng licence.", "Private Residential Tenancy": "Private Residential Tenancy", "The standard private rental in Scotland. It has no fixed end date.": "Ang karaniwang private rental sa Scotland. Wala itong fixed na end date.", "Immigration Health Surcharge": "Immigration Health Surcharge", "The fee paid with a UK visa that lets you use the NHS.": "Ang bayad kasama ng UK visa na nagpapahintulot sa iyong gamitin ang NHS."});
